From 9521cb874a2a85315b7879eda2baaa0fde5a5462 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mike Kinney <mike.kinney@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 12:04:28 -0800
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] fix(trochoid): a Trochoidal slot stays inside its
 selection or is refused

A Trochoidal slot with a face or edge selection generated a path across
the selected pocket's wall into the model and reported OK (the post's
stock-sim gouge clause did refuse it). Generation now checks that the
slot's capsule (centre line A-B, half-width width/2) lies inside the
picked region and refuses by name with the numbers otherwise. The law
lives in operation::slot_fit::refuse_unfit_slot, shareable with the
plain Slot (#1504).

Pinned by trochoid_confine (screenshot setup refused, MCP refusal, a
fitting slot posts clean, the post refuses an unconfined slot into the
model) and slot_fit unit tests.

Refs #1503

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01CUsqDAAAJyAPrC37zBzbbX
